Brand marks in this directory are monochrome `currentColor` SVGs, inlined by
`src/components/OsIcon.astro` so they inherit the surrounding text color.
Per-file provenance is also kept in each SVG's header comment. Upstream
sources and licenses:

- apple.svg — Apple logo, from Font Awesome Free 5 brands (CC BY 4.0),
  via react-icons `FaApple`.
- arch.svg — Arch Linux logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
  via react-icons `SiArchlinux`.
- bazzite.svg — Bazzite "b", lifted from `repo_content/Bazzite.svg` in
  ublue-os/bazzite (Apache-2.0) and normalized to a 24x24 box.
- cachyos.svg — CachyOS logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0).
- debian.svg — Debian swirl, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
  via react-icons `SiDebian`.
- fedora.svg — Fedora logo, from Font Awesome Free 5 brands (CC BY 4.0),
  via react-icons `FaFedora`.
- linux.svg — Tux, from Font Awesome Free 5 brands (CC BY 4.0),
  via react-icons `FaLinux`.
- nixos.svg — NixOS snowflake, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
  via react-icons `SiNixos`.
- nobara.svg — Nobara logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0),
  slug `nobaralinux`.
- omarchy.svg — Omarchy logo, from Simple Icons (CC0 1.0).
- opensuse.svg — openSUSE logo, from Font Awesome Free 5 brands
  (CC BY 4.0), via react-icons `FaSuse`.
- steam.svg — Steam logo, from Font Awesome Free 5 brands (CC BY 4.0),
  via react-icons `FaSteam`.
- ubuntu.svg — Ubuntu Circle of Friends, from Font Awesome Free 5
  brands (CC BY 4.0), via react-icons `FaUbuntu`.
- windows.svg — Modern (Windows 11) four-pane mark: four equal squares,
  no perspective skew. Own geometry, no upstream asset.

